<title>USA: American List sees Q4, year net off.</title>
<headline>American List sees Q4, year net off.</headline>
<dateline>MINEOLA, N.Y. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>American List Corp said that it expects to report earnings for the fourth quarter and year ended February 28 below those of the previous fiscal year.</p>
<p>For the quarter ended February 28, 1996, the company reported revenues of $5.7 million and net income of $0.42 per share.</p>
<p>For the year it reported revenues of $18.9 million and net income of $1.68 per share.</p>
</text>
